<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Press <span class="keyseq"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>N</kbd></span> or <kbd>F11</kbd>, click <b class="button">Save</b>, select <span class="menuseq"><b class="menu">File</b>&#160;<i class="fa fa-angle-right caret"></i> <b class="menuitem">Save As&#8230;&#8203;</b></span> and <span class="menuseq"><b class="menu">View</b>&#160;<i class="fa fa-angle-right caret"></i> <b class="submenu">Zoom</b>&#160;<i class="fa fa-angle-right caret"></i> <b class="menuitem">Reset</b></span>.</p>
