<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="_footnotes_and_index">Footnotes and Index</h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Text with a footnote.<sup class="footnote">[<a id="_footnoteref_1" class="footnote" href="#_footnotedef_1" title="View footnote.">1</a>]</sup>
Another with an id.<sup class="footnote" id="_footnote_fn1">[<a id="_footnoteref_2" class="footnote" href="#_footnotedef_2" title="View footnote.">2</a>]</sup> Reuse it.<sup class="footnoteref">[<a class="footnote" href="#_footnotedef_2" title="View footnote.">2</a>]</sup>
Index terms visible term and  and  and flow.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="_anchors_and_formatting">Anchors and Formatting</h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p><a id="inline-anchor"></a>Anchored text, <a id="another"></a> and <strong id="phrase-id" class="role1 role2">styled phrase</strong>.
<strong>strong</strong> <em>emphasis</em> <code>mono</code> <mark>highlight</mark> <sup>super</sup> <sub>sub</sub> <strong>un</strong>constrained <em>emp</em>hasis <code>mo</code>no <mark>ma</mark>rk.
<span class="underline">underlined</span> <span class="line-through">struck</span> <span class="big">big</span> <span class="small">small</span>.
&#8220;double curved&#8221; &#8216;single curved&#8217; it&#8217;s &#169; &#174; &#8482;&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;&#8230;&#8203; &#8594; &#8658; &#8592; &#8656; &#169; &amp; &#x2122;.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
