<p>Inline \(\sqrt{x^2+1}\) and \(E=mc^2\) and \$sum_(i=1)^n i\$.</p>
</div>
<div class="stemblock">
<div class="content">
\[\int_0^\infty e^{-x} \, dx = 1\]
</div>
</div>
